# Knowledge Base Workflow (mandatory)

This repo maintains a living knowledge base at `kb/knowledge_base.md`.

## Before making ANY change

- Read `kb/knowledge_base.md` first. It documents the architecture, module
  responsibilities, key design decisions (PNG format, replace-semantics
  drawing, sidecar project files, underlay coordinate space), and known
  limitations. Do not re-derive or contradict decisions recorded there
  without flagging it.

## After making ANY change

- Update `kb/knowledge_base.md` to reflect the change:
  - Amend the affected sections (architecture, design decisions, shortcuts,
    limitations) so the doc stays accurate.
  - Add a dated entry to the "Update log" section summarizing what changed
    and why.
  - Refresh the "Last updated" line at the top.

A change is not complete until the knowledge base is updated.
